l50: $ … ⇒ ap (clam x lvals (sclip (fv Env ⟨ u , ⟨ a , lsv q x ⟩ ⟩))) w = sclip (fv Env ⟨ u , ⟨ a , lsv q w ⟩ ⟩) $ by clam_ap [l14]
