l11: $ G , x = ⟨ o , t ⟩ , x ∊ hlit , ∃ l ∃ e (x = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_lit , ⟨ scons l ∅ , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (sclip (fv nnf (fv nvf l))) ⟩) ⇒ ∃ l ∃ e (x = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_lit , ⟨ scons l ∅ , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (sclip (fv nnf (fv nvf l))) ⟩) $ by ax
